          "text": "Thank you for accepting this referral for your 45-year-old female patient, admitted on 18/05 with a 6-week history of worsening low mood, anhedonia, reduced appetite, poor concentration, early-morning waking, and active suicidal ideation with thoughts of overdose, with a primary diagnosis of depressive episode with active suicidal ideation.",
