          ],
          "text": "Here is what happens next:\n\n- The Community Mental Health Team (CMHT) will be in touch within 1 week.\n- Your sertraline dose will be reviewed at 4 weeks.\n- Your GP will keep an eye on your mood and how you are getting on with your medicine.\n\nThe team also gave you a crisis line number before you left."
